    <profile id="4713b6fb-1f9d-4371-a8ea-0f8a970c4224-821f2" name="Explorator Augury Web" page="56" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While the Proteus is on the table, at the start of any of the controlling player's turn, before any reserve rolls are made, the may declare the auguries are being used in either Disruption or Relay mode, their effect lasting until their next player turn. Disruption Mode: Opposing force suffers -1 to Reserve rolls in their next player turn. Relay Mode: Controlling player's Reserve rolls may be re-rolled. Additional Explorator Augury Webs have no effect and only one mode may be chosen a turn. Proteus with an Explorator Augury Web gains Scout and has Transport Capacity reduced to 8.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile id="bb08c422-22ca-64f5-c6d8-2ff437d573a3-821f2" name="Fang of Morkai" page="0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
